# `viola-config` SHAME

Known doc-coverage gaps. Each `## <type>` entry silences the matching `undocumented-type` lint while the design rounds catch up.

## ConfigBytes

Raw byte buffer for the workspace `viola.toml`. Host shim populates this Resource at scheduler-builder time; `LoadConfig` reads it and parses. Fixed-cap byte array plus `arvo::Cap` length tracker; `CONFIG_MAX_BYTES = 16384` caps the buffer at 16KB. Type-shape committed in the Slice 2 DOC CL at `mock/design_rounds/202605241900_changelist.doc.lock.md`; the doc-section addition to `DESIGN.md.tmpl` is the follow-up DOC round's work since Slice 2a's SRC CL phase blocks template edits.

## ConfigArena

Crate-private fixed-cap byte arena that backs every `Str` handle inside one `ViolaConfigOwned`. Implements `hilavitkutin_str::ArenaInterner`. Slice 2a ships the type with `unimplemented!()` `arena_intern` and `arena_resolve`; Slice 2b wires the real intern path. The arena is `pub` only at the trait-impl boundary; the type itself is crate-private and never appears in viola-config's user-facing surface. Design committed in Slice 2 DOC CL.

## ViolaConfigOwned

Owned-form viola config bundling a private arena field plus fixed-cap arrays for plugins, gates, rules, and partial rules. Generic over five cap parameters: `MAX_PLUGINS`, `MAX_GATES`, `MAX_RULES`, `MAX_PARTIAL_RULES`, `ARENA_BYTES`. Self-contained `'static` value so it slots into `Resource<T: 'static>` directly. The bridge between borrowed `ViolaConfig<'a, N>` and Resource-bound shape. Design committed in Slice 2 DOC CL; doc-section addition follows in the DOC round.

## PluginEntryOwned

Placeholder for one plugin entry inside `ViolaConfigOwned`. Zero-sized in Slice 2a. Slice 3 (`LoadPlugins` body) replaces with real fields including `name: Str`, `path: Str`, plus any plugin-manifest metadata the loader needs. Until then the array of `[PluginEntryOwned; MAX_PLUGINS]` exists for type compatibility with the AccessSet contract. Design committed in Slice 2 DOC CL.

## GateOwned

Placeholder for one gate entry inside `ViolaConfigOwned`. Zero-sized in Slice 2a. The validator slices that consume gate configurations replace with real fields (gate name, threshold, override pattern). Until then `[GateOwned; MAX_GATES]` exists for type compatibility. Design committed in Slice 2 DOC CL.

## RuleOwned

Placeholder for one `[[severity]]` rule entry inside `ViolaConfigOwned`. Zero-sized in Slice 2a. The validator slices that consume severity rules replace with real fields (pattern, severity, scope). Until then `[RuleOwned; MAX_RULES]` exists for type compatibility. Design committed in Slice 2 DOC CL.

