Placeholder for one `[[severity.partial]]` rule entry inside `ViolaConfigOwned`. Zero-sized in Slice 2a. The validator slices that consume partial-match rules replace with real fields. Until then `[PartialRuleOwned; MAX_PARTIAL_RULES]` exists for type compatibility. Design committed in Slice 2 DOC CL.
